WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.246
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.497 --> 00:00:05.720
<v><b>F:</b></v> I start work at nine in the morning.

00:00:07.683 --> 00:00:08.309
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:09.767 --> 00:00:12.680
<v><b>M:</b></v> She has a coffee at a quarter past ten.

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:15.416
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:16.838 --> 00:00:19.589
<v><b>F:</b></v> They have a sandwich at a café.

00:00:21.579 --> 00:00:22.253
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:23.756 --> 00:00:26.209
<v><b>M:</b></v> You finish work at six thirty.

00:00:28.279 --> 00:00:29.051
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:33.361
<v><b>F:</b></v> We do housework at the weekend.

00:00:35.343 --> 00:00:36.098
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:39.687
<v><b>M:</b></v> He watches TV in the evening.